---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { generateBreadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';

const title = 'About Us: Independent Gurugram Hotel Directory (2026)';
const description = 'Learn about our independent, transit-aware hotel directory for Gurugram, Haryana. Built to provide verified facts, real commute times, and zero paid placements.';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'About', href: '/about/' }
];

const breadcrumbSchema = generateBreadcrumbSchema([
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'About', url: '/about/' },
]);
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonicalPath="/about/"
  jsonLd={breadcrumbSchema}
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

  <article class="about-page container section-padding">
    <header class="about-masthead">
      <div class="about-kicker-wrap">
        <span class="editorial-kicker">Project Origins & Purpose</span>
        <span class="badge badge-navy">About Us</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="about-h1 font-serif">Independent Accommodation Intelligence for Gurugram</h1>
      <p class="lead about-lead">
        We built this publication to solve a widespread corporate and leisure frustration: online booking portals that prioritize sponsored commissions over real-world traveler utility in Gurugram, Haryana.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-layout-grid">
      <div class="about-main">
        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="font-serif">The Problem with Existing Hotel Portals</h2>
          <div class="about-prose">
            <p>
              Gurugram is one of India’s most commercially vibrant cities, hosting hundreds of multinational headquarters, Fortune 500 corporate campuses, and an affluent dining scene. Yet, when corporate executives or visitors search for accommodation online, they encounter severe obstacles:
            </p>
            <ul class="about-points-list" role="list">
              <li><strong>Deceptive Distance Indicators:</strong> Mainstream travel sites report linear "as-the-crow-flies" distances. In Gurugram, divided expressways like NH-48 mean an office physically 1 km away requires a 20-minute, 5 km flyover U-turn loop.</li>
              <li><strong>Review Inflation:</strong> Budget hotel chains aggressively incentivize guests at check-out desks to post 5-star ratings, obscuring maintenance failures and hygiene lapses.</li>
              <li><strong>Corporate Noise:</strong> Generic "business-friendly" checkboxes hide whether a room actually has an ergonomic work desk, proper lighting, or acoustic soundproofing against 24-hour highway truck traffic.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="font-serif">Our Core Principles</h2>
          <div class="principles-grid">
            <div class="principle-card card">
              <span class="principle-num font-serif">01</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif">Transit-First Accuracy</h3>
              <p>Every profile records real driving times, Rapid Metro walkability, and highway approach routes rather than misleading radial distances.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="principle-card card">
              <span class="principle-num font-serif">02</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif">Zero Paid Inclusions</h3>
              <p>No hotel can pay to be listed, ranked higher, or given preferential editorial copy. The directory is maintained as a transparent public research resource.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="principle-card card">
              <span class="principle-num font-serif">03</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif">Ergonomic Due Diligence</h3>
              <p>We review published specifications for workstation desks, dedicated task chairs, soundproof window glazing, and meeting space capacities.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="principle-card card">
              <span class="principle-num font-serif">04</span>
              <h3 class="font-serif">Community Corrections</h3>
              <p>When hotels renovate rooms, rebrand dining concepts, or alter shuttle services, our public corrections pathway allows swift editorial updates.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="about-section">
          <h2 class="font-serif">Who Manages This Directory?</h2>
          <div class="about-prose">
            <p>
              This publication is curated by independent hospitality and urban transit researchers based in the National Capital Region. We have lived and worked across DLF Cyber City, Golf Course Road, and Sector 29, navigating Gurugram’s monsoon waterlogging, highway interchanges, and rapid transit lines first-hand.
            </p>
            <p>
              We believe travelers deserve unbiased, fact-corroborated lodging profiles that save time, avoid frustration, and prevent bad booking decisions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-sidebar" aria-label="Related directory links">
        <div class="sidebar-card card">
          <h3 class="sidebar-card-title">Editorial Standards</h3>
          <ul class="sidebar-nav" role="list">
            <li><a href="/how-we-choose-hotels/">Selection Methodology</a></li>
            <li><a href="/editorial-policy/">Editorial Policy & Disclosures</a></li>
            <li><a href="/corrections/">Submit a Correction</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact/">Contact Our Desk</a></li>
            <li><a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-masthead {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
  }

  .about-kicker-wrap {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .about-h1 {
    font-size: 2.35rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--navy-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .about-h1 {
      font-size: 3.25rem;
    }
  }

  .about-lead {
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 780px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .about-layout-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-layout-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
    }
  }

  .about-section {
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .about-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    color: var(--navy-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .about-prose p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: var(--prose-max);
  }

  .about-points-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-points-list li {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-points-list li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--forest-primary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-points-list strong {
    color: var(--navy-primary);
  }

  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .principles-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .principle-card {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .principle-num {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    line-height: 1;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--forest-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .principle-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--navy-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .principle-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .sidebar-card {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 5.5rem;
    background-color: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .sidebar-card-title {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .sidebar-nav {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .sidebar-nav a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .sidebar-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--forest-primary);
  }
</style>
